  {"level":4,"name":"变式迁移","question":"a_{n+1}−a_n=2n+1, a₁=2。求 a_n。","answer":"累加：a_n=2+∑_{k=1}^{n−1}(2k+1)=2+2(n−1)n/2+(n−1)=n²+1。验证n=1→2✓, n=2→a₂=2+3=5=n²+1=5✓。"},
